      "notes": "Raw SVG sketch for the selected architecture. This is intentionally text-based so the diagram stays portable in project structure.\n\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"720\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 720\">\n  <defs>\n    <style>\n      .box { fill: #ffffff; stroke: #1f2937; stroke-width: 2; rx: 16; ry: 16; }\n      .head { fill: #e0f2fe; stroke: #0284c7; stroke-width: 2; rx: 16; ry: 16; }\n      .label { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; fill: #111827; }\n      .small { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; fill: #374151; }\n      .arrow { stroke: #6b7280; stroke-width: 3; marker-end: url(#arrowhead); fill: none; }\n    </style>\n    <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#6b7280\" />\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n\n  <rect x=\"390\" y=\"30\" width=\"420\" height=\"90\" class=\"head\"/>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label\">Blazor WebAssembly PWA</text>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"small\">Static-hosted, C#, client-only</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"190\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" class=\"box\"/>\n  <text x=\"210\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label\">Input &amp; game loop</text>\n  <text x=\"210\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"small\">Keyboard, tick, rules</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"460\" y=\"190\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" class=\"box\"/>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label\">SVG board UI</text>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"small\">Grid, pieces, score, state</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"850\" y=\"190\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" class=\"box\"/>\n  <text x=\"990\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label\">Browser storage</text>\n  <text x=\"990\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"small\">localStorage high score</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"250\" y=\"420\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" class=\"box\"/>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"462\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label\">PWA assets</text>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"small\">Manifest, service worker</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"670\" y=\"420\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" class=\"box\"/>\n  <text x=\"810\" y=\"462\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label\">Static hosting</text>\n  <text x=\"810\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"small\">Publish-only deployment</text>\n\n  <path d=\"M 600 120 L 210 190\" class=\"arrow\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 600 120 L 600 190\" class=\"arrow\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 600 120 L 990 190\" class=\"arrow\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 600 120 L 390 420\" class=\"arrow\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 600 120 L 810 420\" class=\"arrow\"/>\n</svg>",
